8	//   Error, and the CLI adapter translates a thrown Error into exit code 1 plus a
9	//   stderr message. Tests below state which layer they observe.
10	// - "A building block of 3 alike components" is read, per the spec examples, as
11	//   exactly-3 groups of the identical component type (4 runes => no block).
